graph LR
    IPP["ai-gateway-payload-processing<br/>(IPP ext_proc + controllers)"]

    %% External Dependencies
    IPP -->|framework, plugins, Helm subchart| IPPLib["llm-d-inference-payload-processor<br/>v0.1.0-rc.4"]
    IPP -->|ext_proc v3 API| EnvoyCP["envoy go-control-plane v1.39.0"]
    IPP -->|gRPC server| GRPC["grpc-go v1.83.2"]
    IPP -->|manager, controllers| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    IPP -->|HTTPRoute types| GWAPI["gateway-api v1.5.1"]
    IPP -->|SigV4 for Bedrock| AWS["aws-sdk-go-v2 v1.42.1"]
    IPP -->|Vertex tokens| OAuth2["golang.org/x/oauth2 v0.36.0"]
    IPP -->|ServiceEntry, DestinationRule, EnvoyFilter| Istio["Istio"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    IPP -->|ext_proc filter, HTTPRoute parent| MaaSGW["MaaS Gateway<br/>maas-default-gateway"]
    IPP -.->|filter-chain anchor| Kuadrant["Kuadrant Wasm"]
    IPP -.->|subset hints, hub mode| EPP["llm-d EPP"]
    IPP -.->|cross-cluster routing| RemoteMaaS["Remote RHOAI/ODH MaaS"]

    %% Integration Points
    MaaSCtrl["maas-controller"] -->|reads status, may own Deployment| IPP
    AGC["ai-gateway-controller<br/>(AGC / Praxis)"] -.->|ownership hand-off| IPP
    Prometheus["Prometheus"] -->|scrape 9090| IPP

    %% External Services
    IPP -->|CRDs, Secrets, networking CRUD| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    IPP -->|routed via Gateway| Providers["External LLM Providers"]
    IPP -->|token minting| GoogleOAuth["Google OAuth2"]
    IPP -.->|optional| Nemo["NeMo Guardrails"]
    IPP -.->|optional| Metering["External Metering"]

